    "text": "1 days ago Since the opening of the Pro Football Hall of Fame in 1963, summer in Canton, Ohio, has meant celebrating those who made significant contributions to the game of football. This August, five former players will receive football’s highest honor: DREW BREES, ROGER CRAIG, LARRY FITZGERALD, LUKE KUECHLY and ADAM VINATIERI. Read full article",
